{"content":[{"c":["SORCERY"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Practice whose adherents claim to have supernatural powers and knowledge; the ability to foretell the future and to summon evil spirits through charms and magical spells. Sorcerers were present in the high courts of Egypt (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.7.11","r":"Exod.7.11","rawR":"Exod.7.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.7.11","value":"Exod.7.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 7:11"},"), Assyria (",{"href":"?bref=Nah.3.4","r":"Nah.3.4","rawR":"Nah.3.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Nah.3.4","value":"Nah.3.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Na 3:4"},"), and Babylonia (",{"href":"?bref=Dan.2.2","r":"Dan.2.2","rawR":"Dan.2.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.2.2","value":"Dan.2.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dn 2:2"},"). Sorcery was forbidden in Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.18.10","r":"Deut.18.10","rawR":"Deut.18.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.18.10","value":"Deut.18.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 18:10"},") and was punishable by death (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.22.18","r":"Exod.22.18","rawR":"Exod.22.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.22.18","value":"Exod.22.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 22:18"},"). Nonetheless, Israel sought out sorcerers (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.17.17","r":"2Kgs.17.17","rawR":"2Kgs.17.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.17.17","value":"2Kgs.17.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 17:17"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.33.6","r":"2Chr.33.6","rawR":"2Chr.33.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.33.6","value":"2Chr.33.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 33:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Mic.5.12","r":"Mic.5.12","rawR":"Mic.5.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mic.5.12","value":"Mic.5.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mi 5:12"},"), provoking God’s anger against her (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.57.3","r":"Isa.57.3","rawR":"Isa.57.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.57.3","value":"Isa.57.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 57:3"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Mal.3.5","r":"Mal.3.5","rawR":"Mal.3.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mal.3.5","value":"Mal.3.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mal 3:5"},"). Paul included it in a list of sinful works (",{"href":"?bref=Gal.5.20","r":"Gal.5.20","rawR":"Gal.5.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gal.5.20","value":"Gal.5.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gal 5:20"},"), and the book of Revelation condemned its practitioners to the lake of fire (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.21.8","r":"Rev.21.8","rawR":"Rev.21.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.21.8","value":"Rev.21.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rv 21:8"},") and to eternal separation from the righteous (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.22.15","r":"Rev.22.15","rawR":"Rev.22.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.22.15","value":"Rev.22.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"22:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Magic_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Magic_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Magic_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Magic"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Sorcery","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 7:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.7.11","rawQueryValue":"Exod.7.11","sourceRefExact":"Exod.7.11"},{"anchorText":"Na 3:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Nah.3.4","rawQueryValue":"Nah.3.4","sourceRefExact":"Nah.3.4"},{"anchorText":"Dn 2:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Dan.2.2","rawQueryValue":"Dan.2.2","sourceRefExact":"Dan.2.2"},{"anchorText":"Dt 18:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.18.10","rawQueryValue":"Deut.18.10","sourceRefExact":"Deut.18.10"},{"anchorText":"Ex 22:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.22.18","rawQueryValue":"Exod.22.18","sourceRefExact":"Exod.22.18"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 17:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.17.17","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.17.17","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.17.17"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 33:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.33.6","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.33.6","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.33.6"},{"anchorText":"Mi 5:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Mic.5.12","rawQueryValue":"Mic.5.12","sourceRefExact":"Mic.5.12"},{"anchorText":"Is 57:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.57.3","rawQueryValue":"Isa.57.3","sourceRefExact":"Isa.57.3"},{"anchorText":"Mal 3:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Mal.3.5","rawQueryValue":"Mal.3.5","sourceRefExact":"Mal.3.5"},{"anchorText":"Gal 5:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gal.5.20","rawQueryValue":"Gal.5.20","sourceRefExact":"Gal.5.20"},{"anchorText":"Rv 21:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.21.8","rawQueryValue":"Rev.21.8","sourceRefExact":"Rev.21.8"},{"anchorText":"22:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.22.15","rawQueryValue":"Rev.22.15","sourceRefExact":"Rev.22.15"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"dcd5f0d7bd8339c6d306b0b229c26a238689e9821f0699729b82b8937cd69294","sourceItemName":"Sorcery","sourceItemOrder":506,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Sorcery","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Sorcery","title":"Sorcery","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}